cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EWSAtlas, please cite both the preprint and the Zenodo deposit."
title: "EWSAtlas: a harmonized single-cell reference for Ewing sarcoma"
abstract: >-
  Integrated single-cell and single-nucleus atlas of Ewing sarcoma assembled from
  six public studies (138,353 cells, 65 samples, 38 patients), with a
  copy-number-validated malignant compartment and a reference-mapping model.
